			"displayName": "ClipboardHistory",
			"description": "ClipHistory tracks clipboard activity, automatically saving text and HTML entries to persistent storage. Features include an accessible history dialog, pinning, custom item names, editing, reordering, item deletion, and pasting support for NVDA.\n\nHot Keys:\nWindows+V\nSingle : open ClipHistory Dialog\nDouble : Clear All ClipBoardHistory"
